---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /portal/
title: Team portal
description: Register your team's details, logo and squad for the new season.
noindex: true
noAnalytics: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--compact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Season registration</div>
    <h1>Team portal</h1>
    <p>Your team's details, logo and squad, in one place. Editable until the organisers lock the season.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--portal">
  <div
    class="wrap">
    {#- Key dates and fee: edit site.json -> registration. -#}
    {% set reg = site.registration %}
    {% if reg and reg.show %}
      <div class="panel panel--accent reg-info">
        <h2 class="reg-info__title">Season {{ reg.season }}: what you need to know</h2>
        <ol class="reg-dates">
          <li>
            <span class="reg-dates__when">{{ reg.signUpDeadline | readableDate("d LLLL yyyy") }}</span>
            <span>
              <strong>Sign-up deadline.</strong>
              Your team details and a full squad of minimum {{ reg.minSquadSize }} players, entered here. Invoices go out the same
              day. Teams that sign up later are invoiced straight away.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="reg-dates__when">{{ reg.paymentDeadline | readableDate("d LLLL yyyy") }}</span>
            <span>
              <strong>Payment deadline.</strong>
              We book the season's pitches in December, so we need every team paid by then.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="reg-info__fee">
          <strong>Fee: £{{ reg.fee.toLocaleString("en-GB") }} per team.</strong>
          {{ reg.feeNote }} It covers pitches and referees, plus trophies and the end-of-season do.</p>
        <p class="muted">Short of {{ reg.minSquadSize }} players? Tell us before the deadline, or try the
          <a href="/free-agents/">free-agent pool</a>. New team?
          <a href="/contact/?topic=Entering%20a%20team">Get in touch</a>
          and we'll invite you. Before you sign off your squad, read the
          <a href="/rules/">rules</a>.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div id="portal" class="portal">
      <noscript>
        <div class="panel">
          <p>The team portal needs JavaScript switched on.</p>
        </div>
      </noscript>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/portal-config.njk" %}
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/portal/portal.js"></script>